{"id":"P043-2","subject":"P","unit":"P043","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 1~50문항","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P043-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n 위 블록선도의 특성방정식은 (    ㉠      )이고,\n\n 특성근이 우반면에 ( ㉡ )개가 존재하므로 (  ㉢    )\n\n 하다.\n\n\n         ㉠        ㉡     ㉢\n ①             안정\n ②             안정\n ③             불안정\n ④             불안정\n ⑤            임계안정","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":1088},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1031}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n가 입력, 가 출력일 때, 다음의 미분방정식에\n\n대한 전달함수는? (단, , ′이다.)\n\n                                               \n\n\n\n                      \n①            ② \n                 \n③            ④ \n   \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":786},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":851}],"responseType":